cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its associated resources, please cite it as below."

title: "Core Models: Index of Data Models"

authors:
  - name: "Sage Bionetworks"

abstract: >-
  Core Models provides a centralized, browsable index
  of registered Synapse JSON Schemas across Sage
  Bionetworks data coordinating centers. The resource
  supports metadata discovery, schema exploration,
  validation, and standardized data management
  across research initiatives.

version: "1.0.0"

repository-code: "https://github.com/Sage-Bionetworks/core-models"

url: "https://sage-bionetworks.github.io/core-models/"

keywords:
  - metadata
  - data models
  - JSON Schema
  - Synapse
  - interoperability
  - data standardization
